BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dec 8 | Brave Little State at 14th Star Brewery
DTSTART:20261208T173000
DTEND:20261208T193000
DTSTAMP:20261112T185931Z
UID:4c2a00fcf37891014a73a9774ef8f3@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join the team from Brave Little State on December 8 in St. Alb
 ans to mingle with fellow listeners and choose a topic for a future episod
 e. Take part in a spirited live voting round where you and other attendees
  can submit your questions about Vermont for the team to consider. The top
  three question askers will be invited to “stump” for their question a
 s the audience votes on their favorite. We’ll have some Brave Little Sta
 te merch to show off your fan status or for holiday gifting. Bring your bu
 rning questions about Vermont\, the show or how our stories get made. Tick
 ets are $10 and support Brave Little State and Vermont Public. The first 1
 00 attendees will receive a vintage Lawson’s Brave Little State Pale Ale
  pint glass. Click here to reserve your ticket . If space allows\, tickets
  will be available at the door. This event is made possible with support f
 rom Union Bank and Northwestern Medical Center . Schedule 5:30 p.m. - Even
 t begins 5:45 p.m. - Welcome | Question submissions begin 6:30 p.m. - Ques
 tion submission ends | Voting round begins 7:00 p.m. - Voting round ends |
  Winners are announced 7:30 p.m. - Event ends Accommodations Vermont Publi
 c is committed to providing access and accommodation for individuals with 
 disabilities at our events. To request accommodations\, please email event
 s@vermontpublic.org or call us at 802-655-9451 at least seven days in adva
 nce of the event. Cancellation Policy Please let us know by emailing event
 s@vermontpublic.org if you are not able to join us so that we may release 
 your tickets to someone else. If tickets are able to be resold\, we are ha
 ppy to offer a refund\, minus the processing fees. Directions and Parking 
 14th Star Brewing Co. is located at 133 N Main St #7\, St Albans City\, VT
  05478 . There is plenty of free parking in the St. Albans Shopping Center
  parking lot. Other questions? Email us at events@vermontpublic.org .\n\nS
 ources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:14th Star Brewery\, 133 N Main St Ste 7
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/dec-1-brav
 e-little-state-at-14th-star-brewery-02-09-2026-10-48-40
END:VEVENT
